 on glycaemic responses&amp;author=S.M. Tosh&amp;author=Y. Chu&amp;volume=114&amp;publication_year=2015&amp;pages=1256-1262&amp;pmid=26330200&amp;doi=10.1017/S0007114515002895&amp;"/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B6-nutrients-12-02275"><label>6.</label><mixed-citation><named-content content-type="citation-string">Wolever T.M.S., Katzman-Relle L., Jenkins A.L., Vuksan V., Josse R.G., Jenkins D.J.A. Glycaemic index of 102 complex carbohydrate foods in patients with diabetes. Nutr. Res. 1994;14:651–669. doi: 10.1016/S0271-5317(05)80201-5.</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1016/S0271-5317(05)80201-5"/><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="journal=Nutr. Res.&amp;title=Glycaemic index of 102 complex carbohydrate foods in patients with diabetes&amp;author=T.M.S. Wolever&amp;author=L. Katzman-Relle&amp;author=A.L. Jenkins&amp;author=V. Vuksan&amp;author=R.G. Josse&amp;volume=14&amp;publication_year=1994&amp;pages=651-669&amp;doi=10.1016/S0271-5317(05)80201-5&amp;"/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B7-nutrients-12-02275"><label>7.</label><mixed-citation><named-content content-type="citation-string">Wolever T.M.S., van Klinken B.J.W., Spruill S.E., Jenkins A.L., Chu Y., Harkness L. Effect of serving size and addition of sugar on the glycemic response elicited by oatmeal: A randomized, cross-over study. Clin. Nutr. ESPEN. 2016;16:48–54. doi: 10.1016/j.clnesp.2016.07.003.</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1016/j.clnesp.2016.07.003"/><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="pmid" xlink:href="28531455"/><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="journal=Clin. Nutr. ESPEN&amp;title=Effect of serving size and addition of sugar on the glycemic response elicited by oatmeal: A randomized, cross-over study&amp;aut